{"completed": true, "response": "这种亲近的可能，还是会让他感到温暖和开心。只是，他越珍惜这份感觉，就越清楚地意识到，靠近对方也可能影响自己一直看重的自由自在。所以，这份熟悉的温柔再次让他感到充实，却不再像以前那样轻松，没有任何顾虑。他心里的愿望并没有因为不安而消失，但他还没有开始明确期待对方的回应，也没有期待这段关系一定会有什么结果。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3f46cc24-c663-4754-b6f5-d14aacb0289d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003110937845Z", "elapsed_seconds": 6.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:31:16.944414+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e0986dcb87e4c60856eb8ea3f56d4b04eb71a7d92c7b0932da62a5f2504242d5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003110937845Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9bd7d577